  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#f00\"><strong>MOA裝飾：電子產品</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\"><em>這是一款裝飾模組，旨在新增節慶主題物件來佈置您的建築。目前已有數款新增家具的模組，本模組旨在成為它們的補充，因為您可以找到數百種不同的物件與元素來裝飾您的世界。此為&nbsp;</em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><em>MOA裝飾</em><em>&nbsp;系列</em></strong></span><em>的又一模組。</em></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/858/892/moa-electronicos10.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1362\" height=\"950\"></em></strong></span></span></p><h3><strong>合成方式</strong></h3><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/858/880/c-electronicos-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"482\" height=\"230\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\">模組中的所有物品皆可在生存模式中取得。要開始製作這些物件，您必須在工作台上放置<strong>紅色</strong>染料與綠寶石，如此您將獲得&nbsp;<strong>9顆電子寶石</strong>，透過將它們與其他材料組合，即可取得裝飾物品。<strong>共有多達150種不同物品！</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/858/881/c-electronicos-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"480\" height=\"228\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\"><strong>範例：</strong>若想取得Game Cube模型，合成時必須擁有電子寶石，以及該物品的額外材料（本例為鐵錠、鐵粒、線、青金石與4份紅色染料）。部分二級合成品由兩種模型的物件組合而成，此類情況不需額外使用電子寶石，因其已在前置合成中消耗。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/858/882/moa-electronicos1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1473\" height=\"553\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/858/883/moa-electronicos2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1473\" height=\"561\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/858/884/moa-electronicos3.jpg\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/858/885/moa-electronicos4.jpg\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/858/886/moa-electronicos5.jpg\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/858/887/moa-electronicos6.jpg\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/858/888/moa-electronicos7.jpg\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/858/894/moa-electronicos11.jpg\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/858/890/moa-electronicos9.jpg\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/858/889/moa-electronicos8.png\"></span></p><h2><em><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><u>注意：</u></strong>&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">為獲得完整體驗，建議參閱&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>MOA裝飾系列</strong></span>的其他模組，內含更多與本模組互補的類別</span>。</em></h2><p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-cookery\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/636/472/638039093834758638.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-art\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/636/441/638039045898196915.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-science\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/636/488/638039109952819535.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-toys\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/636/495/638039124454094910.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-bath\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/808/248/638178193015946116.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-lights\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/853/442/638257035280816288.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-garden\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/872/565/638291506409003759.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-holidays\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/885/795/638321626215674397.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-electronics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/990/90/638503048724039895.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a></p>\n\n（翻譯說明：1. 保留所有HTML標籤與格式 2. 將\"catalog\"譯為「系列」更符合中文語境 3. \"Crafting\"統一譯為「合成方式」符合Minecraft術語 4. 將被動語態轉換為主動語態 5. 技術名詞如「電子寶石」採用意譯 6. 調整長句結構使其符合中文閱讀習慣）",
